  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add ginger and garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add fish sauce (if using) and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let simmer for 15-20 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in curry leaves and serve hot over rice or noodles.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro or scallions, if desired."
